      "writtenOn": "2023-01-09T13:22:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d like to have the initrd logic here and leave` Payload::verify_partition()` a pvmfw customized wrapper. It\u0027s explained in the comment above. Let\u0027s follow up this subject in that comment.",
      "parentUuid": "e341d692_c80025e9",
